# Greenhead public XRPL validator — validators.txt placeholder
#
# The node still needs a trusted validator list before it can sync.
# That list is chosen when the Linux host arrives. This file is not that list.
#
# Do not paste a third-party UNL here. On the host, put the chosen
# list in the live validators.txt next to rippled.cfg.
#
# Sections the live file will use, left empty on purpose:
#
# [validator_list_sites]
# One HTTPS URL per line, for a publisher you decide to trust.
#
# [validator_list_keys]
# The publisher public key that signs that list, one per line.
#
# [validators]
# Individual validator public keys, only if you are listing them
# yourself. One key per line. Not a copied UNL.
